/P 73 0 R
/E (April was the best month since the inception of the BrainlyHQ server. Community activity reached a record high - we exceeded 23,000 messages sent, which clearly confirms a very high level of user engagement. Many new members also joined Discord, and the dynamics of conversations and initiatives significantly accelerated, making this month a breakthrough for the entire project.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
92 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (A significant development step was the launch of the official economy, which directly translated into an increase in the number of active users and a real revitalization of the community. At the same time, intensive work continues on the Science Scavengers project, demonstrating that functional development is progressing steadily. Brainly Core is also gaining popularity - our bot received a new graphic design and is being used by users more and more frequently.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
93 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (In April, Brainly Lab and consolidated reports received a new visual layout, improving readability and visual consistency across the ecosystem. Brainly Lab teams actively support the management in the day-to-day operation of the server as well as in designing and implementing new features, which significantly streamlines decision-making and development processes. The following sections of the report will present detailed numerical data, further confirming the strong condition of the server during this period.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
