/E (This report summarizes a highly dynamic month of development and community engagement within Brainly HQ, marked by both strong activity and meaningful functional progress. During the period, the server recorded a total of 23,206 messages, including 6,616 user messages, 14,024 bot messages, and 2,566 webhook messages, demonstrating high participation and the growing role of automation. Additionally, 2,056 messages contained attachments, and the community continued to grow, reaching 1,002 registered users by the end of the month.)
